/*
 * Minimal Arrow Flight SQL server for protocol benchmark comparisons.
 *
 * The read path serves deterministic Arrow IPC files generated by this
 * binary.  The write path retains ingested batches only so the benchmark can
 * verify its result.  This is test tooling, not a general-purpose SQL service.
 */

